{
    "title": "Tilescapes - Onnect Match Game",
    "description": "Tilescapes Connect is the free-to-play, addictive tile-matching puzzle game! Match tiles to solve this pair matching puzzle game with thousands of challenging levels! Match tiles with amazing themes: Cute Animals \ud83d\udc36, Beautiful Flowers \ud83c\udf38, Delicious Food \ud83c\udf55, Fresh Fruits \ud83e\udd51 and more to improve your <b>memory</b> and <b>train your brain</b>!\r\n\r\n\u25b6\ufe0f<b>HOW TO PLAY?</b> \u25b6\ufe0f\r\nTilescapes Connect is an extremely easy-to-play THEMED tile matching game for all ages!\r\n1. Your mission? Clear the board of all tiles before time runs out \u23f1\r\n2. Connect matching tiles to eliminate rows and lines \ud83d\udca5\r\n3. Level up & earn coins to power-up and complete the most challenging levels \ud83d\udcaa\r\n\r\n\u2705 <b>SPECIAL FEATURES</b> \u2705\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Unlock 40+ fun TILE SETS: Wildlife, Seashore, Desserts, Animals, Drinks, and more!\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Relax with over 30 beautiful puzzle BACKGROUNDS: Northern Lights, Beach, Forest, Cherry Blossoms, and more!\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Move up the map by collecting stars and leveling up \u2b50\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Progress even faster with special link game power-ups: Hint, Rotate, Bomb, Shuffle, and a Rocket that blasts 4 TILES at once\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Never miss a beat with the Revive After Fail feature\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Log in every day to collect your Daily Bonus! \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc9f <b>HIGHLIGHTS</b> \ud83d\udc9f\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Play offline! No Wi-Fi needed\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Play on any device (phone & tablet friendly)\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Play without audio if you\u2019re on the go\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Suitable for all ages\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Multiple languages supported\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Tilescapes Connect costs nothing to download and play!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde0 <b>BRAIN TRAINING BENEFITS</b> \ud83e\udde0\r\nInspired by the classic, ancient Chinese tile-based game of Mahjong: Tilescapes Connect is bound to get your cogs turning, as well as offering a number of other mental health benefits.\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Acting as a \u201cmind sport\u201d - Tilescapes Connect is designed to train your brain while captivating you through challenging, themed levels\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Wind down after a long day by relieving stress & relaxing with an intuitive puzzle game\r\n\u25aa\ufe0f Stimulate your brain in a low-stress environment with puzzles and incredibly cute graphics\r\n\r\nDownload now to play <b>Tilescapes Connect free</b> on Android, one of the best free puzzle games of 2021! Do you have what it takes to become a true tile-matching master? \ud83d\udc51",
    "descriptionHTML": "Tilescapes Connect is the free-to-play, addictive tile-matching puzzle game! Match tiles to solve this pair matching puzzle game with thousands of challenging levels! Match tiles with amazing themes: Cute Animals \ud83d\udc36, Beautiful Flowers \ud83c\udf38, Delicious Food \ud83c\udf55, Fresh Fruits \ud83e\udd51 and more to improve your <b>memory</b> and <b>train your brain</b>!<br><br>\u25b6\ufe0f<b>HOW TO PLAY?</b> \u25b6\ufe0f<br>Tilescapes Connect is an extremely easy-to-play THEMED tile matching game for all ages!<br>1. Your mission? Clear the board of all tiles before time runs out \u23f1<br>2. Connect matching tiles to eliminate rows and lines \ud83d\udca5<br>3. Level up &amp; earn coins to power-up and complete the most challenging levels \ud83d\udcaa<br><br>\u2705 <b>SPECIAL FEATURES</b> \u2705<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Unlock 40+ fun TILE SETS: Wildlife, Seashore, Desserts, Animals, Drinks, and more!<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Relax with over 30 beautiful puzzle BACKGROUNDS: Northern Lights, Beach, Forest, Cherry Blossoms, and more!<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Move up the map by collecting stars and leveling up \u2b50<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Progress even faster with special link game power-ups: Hint, Rotate, Bomb, Shuffle, and a Rocket that blasts 4 TILES at once<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Never miss a beat with the Revive After Fail feature<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Log in every day to collect your Daily Bonus! <br><br>\ud83d\udc9f <b>HIGHLIGHTS</b> \ud83d\udc9f<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Play offline! No Wi-Fi needed<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Play on any device (phone &amp; tablet friendly)<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Play without audio if you\u2019re on the go<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Suitable for all ages<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Multiple languages supported<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Tilescapes Connect costs nothing to download and play!<br><br>\ud83e\udde0 <b>BRAIN TRAINING BENEFITS</b> \ud83e\udde0<br>Inspired by the classic, ancient Chinese tile-based game of Mahjong: Tilescapes Connect is bound to get your cogs turning, as well as offering a number of other mental health benefits.<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Acting as a \u201cmind sport\u201d - Tilescapes Connect is designed to train your brain while captivating you through challenging, themed levels<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Wind down after a long day by relieving stress &amp; relaxing with an intuitive puzzle game<br>\u25aa\ufe0f Stimulate your brain in a low-stress environment with puzzles and incredibly cute graphics<br><br>Download now to play <b>Tilescapes Connect free</b> on Android, one of the best free puzzle games of 2021! Do you have what it takes to become a true tile-matching master? \ud83d\udc51",
